# Ensure shell scripts always use LF line endings (required for Linux containers).
# Added 2026-09-11 after a `git checkout` under core.autocrlf=true rewrote MissionCommander/docker-entrypoint.sh
# as CRLF and crash-looped the Commander container on the next image build. Mirrors MissionDesigner/.gitattributes.
*.sh text eol=lf

# Mission Designer / Commander packages are ZIP files: never convert line endings.
# Every ZIP format in docs/JSON_SCHEMA.md §2 is listed here. The bare-JSON formats
# (.WFmaster, .WFenvir, .WFaction, .WFlib, .WFslib) are deliberately absent: they are
# text and should keep normal line-ending handling.
# Without an explicit attribute git falls back to sniffing for NUL bytes, which does
# catch a ZIP in practice — but that is a heuristic, not a guarantee, and this repo has
# already been bitten once by autocrlf rewriting a file it should not have (see above).
*.WFmasterX binary
*.WFlibX binary
*.WFstepLibX binary
*.WFslibX binary
*.WFenvirX binary
*.WFenvirLibX binary
*.WFenvirBundleX binary
*.WFactionLibX binary
*.WFactionCode binary
*.WFactionCodeX binary
*.WFcenterX binary
*.WFsnapshot binary
